Kaynak listeleri / Upstream lists
---------------------------------

Bazı kayıtlar başka derlemelerde bulunup buraya alındı. Açıklamalar burada
yazıldı; bir kaynaktan yalnızca adlar, adresler ve seçim alındı. Bir kaynağın
seçiminden gelen kayıtlar, o kaynağın kendi lisans ve telif bildirimini korur
(MIT, CC0, CC BY-SA vb.). CC BY 4.0 bu seçimlerin üzerine eklenen düzenlemeyi
ve metni kapsar, kaynağın kendi haklarını kapsamaz.

Some records were found in other compilations. Their descriptions were written
here; only names, addresses and the selection itself were taken from the
source. Records that come from a source's selection keep that source's licence
and copyright notice (MIT, CC0, CC BY-SA and so on); CC BY 4.0 covers the
arrangement and the text added on top of that selection, not the source's own
rights. Where a source states no licence, nothing beyond names, addresses and
the fact of inclusion is reused from it.

Every source, its licence (SPDX id, or "unspecified" / "all-rights-reserved")
and its copyright holder are listed in data/sources.py and on the site's
credits page (k/en/credits.html, k/tesekkur.html).

Text submitted through the "Suggest a link" issue form is published under
CC BY 4.0; the form asks the submitter to agree to that.
